OL,3,GNEWSAIsle of Man could get first female
OL,4,Achief minister
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Isle of Man could have its first
OL,7,Ffemale chief minister, depending on the
OL,8,Foutcome of a crucial vote later this
OL,9,Fmonth.
OL,11,FArbory, Castletown and Malew member
OL,12,FKirrie Jenkins is up against Douglas
OL,13,FCentral's Chris Thomas for the top job
OL,14,Fin Tynwald.
OL,16,FMembers will vote for their preferred
OL,17,Fcandidate in the historic parliament on
OL,18,F13 October.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB IOM NewsC Reg TVF Clean Feed
